  "question": {
    "text": "Let \\(A\\) be the point \\((0,4)\\) in the xy-plane and let \\(B\\) be the point \\((2 t, 0)\\). Let \\(L\\) be the midpoint of \\(A B\\) and let the perpendicular bisector of \\(A B\\) meet the \\(y\\)-axis \\(M\\). Let \\(N\\) be the midpoint of LM. Then locus of \\(N\\) is",
    "image": null
