  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/qNKw4XizkTf8Pj6wEryy1Wf5HqfbGZ7gvfJg5emvORg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nEquation of LM\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& y-2=\\frac{t}{2}(x-t) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow M\\left(0, \\frac{4-t^2}{2}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nMidpoint of LM : N(h, k)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad 2 h=t, 2 k=4-\\frac{t^2}{2} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\quad x^2=2-y\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
